  +'ntern, en-US - tjeneste). \"empty\" - send ikke."'#13#10#13#10'#: tformconf'
  +'igtrayslate.labellanguages1.caption'#13#10'msgid "Value type for populating'
  +' names. None keeps originals; None and Unit are case-sensitive."'#13#10'msg'
