  +'#: tformconfigtrayslate.labellanguagestarget.caption'#13#10'msgid ""'#13#10
  +'"Target languages e.g. en=en-US, en - internal, en-US - service code.\n"'#13
  +#10'"If not specified, both source and target languages are taken from the l'
