  +'tes"'#13#10'msgstr "Maks l'#195#166'ngde, bytes"'#13#10#13#10'#: tformconfi'
  +'gtrayslate.labelmethod.caption'#13#10'msgid "Method"'#13#10'msgstr "Metode"'
  +#13#10#13#10'#: tformconfigtrayslate.labelparemeters.caption'#13#10'msgid "U'
  +'se parameters: {text} '#226#128#147' input text, {source} '#226#128#147' so'
  +'urce language, {target} '#226#128#147' target language. Prefix the name wit'
  +'h ! for lowercase or ^ for uppercase value. Also supported {timestamp}, {ra'
  +'nd}. Use {parameter} from the parameters page."'#13#10'msgstr "Brug paramet'
  +'re: {text} '#226#128#147' indtastet tekst, {source} '#226#128#147' kildespr'
  +'og, {target} '#226#128#147' m'#195#165'lsprog. Pr'#195#166'fikset ! for sm'
  +#195#165' bogstaver eller ^ for store bogstaver. Underst'#195#184'tter ogs'
