  +'ith embedded regular expressions are processed.\n"'#13#10'"Regex: {prefix {'
  +'regex[index]} suffix} inside a text block. If no [index] is specified, the '
  +'first match is used.\n"'#13#10'"Index can be a number, [*] (join by space),'
  +' or [*#10] (join by newline). If the regex finds no match, the entire {'#226
  +#128#166'} block is removed.\n"'#13#10'"Using ~ inside a regex returns the e'
  +'ntire text.\n"'#13#10'"Inversion: Start a segment with ! (e.g. !/path{Error'
  +'}) to show its text only if the Pointer data is missing or the JSON is inva'
