  +'trayslate.labellanguagestarget.caption'#13#10'msgid ""'#13#10'"Target langu'
  +'ages e.g. en=en-US, en - internal, en-US - service code.\n"'#13#10'"If not '
  +'specified, both source and target languages are taken from the languages se'
