  +'ons dengan Skrip"'#13#10#13#10'#: tformconfigtrayslate.imagepreview.hint'#13
  +#10'msgid "Click to select the config icon, Middle-Click clears the icon"'#13
  ,#10'msgstr "Klik untuk memilih ikon konfigurasi, Middle-Click menghapus ikon'
  +'"'#13#10#13#10'#: tformconfigtrayslate.labelaccept.caption'#13#10'msgid "Ac'
