  +'slate.labellanguagestarget.caption'#13#10'msgid ""'#13#10'"Target languages'
  +' e.g. en=en-US, en - internal, en-US - service code.\n"'#13#10'"If not spec'
  +'ified, both source and target languages are taken from the languages sectio'
  +'n."'#13#10'msgstr ""'#13#10'"Bahasa sasaran misalnya en=en-US, en - interna'
  +'l, en-US - kode layanan.\n"'#13#10'"Jika tidak ditentukan, baik bahasa sumb'
  +'er maupun sasaran diambil dari bagian bahasa."'#13#10#13#10'#: tformconfigt'
