  +' "Enter new config file name:"'#13#10'msgstr "'#230#150#176#227#129#151#227
  +#129#132#232#168#173#229#174#154#227#131#149#227#130#161#227#130#164#227#131
  +#171#229#144#141#227#130#146#229#133#165#229#138#155#227#129#151#227#129#166
  +#227#129#143#227#129#160#227#129#149#227#129#132#239#188#154'"'#13#10#13#10
  +'#: formconfig.rneedsave'#13#10'msgid "The configuration was modified. Save '
  +'changes?"'#13#10'msgstr "'#232#168#173#229#174#154#227#129#140#229#164#137
  +#230#155#180#227#129#149#227#130#140#227#129#190#227#129#151#227#129#159#227
  +#128#130#229#164#137#230#155#180#227#130#146#228#191#157#229#173#152#227#129
  +#151#227#129#190#227#129#153#227#129#139#239#188#159'"'#13#10#13#10'#: formc'
  +'onfig.rresponsehint'#13#10'msgid ""'#13#10'"Json Pointer: Use / for levels,'
  +' keys for objects, and numbers for indexes.\n"'#13#10'"Use * for all items,'
  +' *#10 to join items by newline. Use ~ at the end of the path to return the '
  +'raw JSON branch.\n"'#13#10'"Separate multiple segments with semicolon ;.\n"'
  +#13#10'"Literal: Text block in {'#226#128#166'}. Special tag #10 for newline'
  ,'s. Use {{regex}} inside to extract data directly into the text.\n"'#13#10'"'
  +'Logic: If a Pointer in a segment is empty, the whole segment is skipped. If'
  +' a segment has no Pointer, only literal text blocks with embedded regular e'
  +'xpressions are processed.\n"'#13#10'"Regex: {prefix {regex[index]} suffix} '
  +'inside a text block. If no [index] is specified, the first match is used.\n'
  +'"'#13#10'"Index can be a number, [*] (join by space), or [*#10] (join by ne'
  +'wline). If the regex finds no match, the entire {'#226#128#166'} block is r'
  +'emoved.\n"'#13#10'"Using ~ inside a regex returns the entire text.\n"'#13#10
  +'"Inversion: Start a segment with ! (e.g. !/path{Error}) to show its text on'
  +'ly if the Pointer data is missing or the JSON is invalid.\n"'#13#10'"Commen'
  +'ting: /* text */ comments are stripped from the entire expression before an'
  +'y processing.\n"'#13#10'"Examples:\n"'#13#10'"responseData/translatedText; '
  +'matches/*#10/translation; /texts/text; {literal text#10}; /result/text; /te'
  +'xt{ ({(\\w+)})}; !/translations{Error: No data!#10}; /translations/0/text"'
  +#13#10'msgstr ""'#13#10'"JSON Pointer: '#227#131#172#227#131#153#227#131#171
